  "token_cases_comment": "Answers to the dashboard's token step (GET /hermux/token on the hello's connection, which must carry X-Hermux-Auth: 1 <kid> <ns> <nc> <mac>), after a good dashboard hello. {BODY} is {\"hermux\":1,\"token\":<token>,\"proof\":<proof>} with fields in 'set' replaced by raw JSON text, {LEN} its length, {PAD:n} n letters x. 'proof' says how the proof is made: good (answer, token, over both nonces and the token's SHA-256), other_key, other_token (over another token's SHA-256), client_dir (direction client), swapped (the two nonces swapped), upper (good, in upper case), other_addr (over another port's address), other_role (role events), replay (over an earlier exchange's nonces). expect: 'token <the token>', a reason, or 'error bad answer'.",
